+ log CommandLog'Step
+ step Step
+ previous U64?

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is CommandHistoryEntry ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do undo

. index = log.index-of(step.id)
=? if index == null
log.remove(index)
log.replay(CommandReplayKind.history, index)

────────────────────
+ do redo

=? if log.index-of(step.id) != null
. index = log.place-after(step, previous)
log.replay(CommandReplayKind.history, index)

