CommandLogInsertEntry'Step(log, step, previous).undo()

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ CommandLogRangeEntry'Step is Tuple
    is CommandHistoryEntry

+ log CommandLog'Step
+ steps [Step]
+ previous U64?
+ inserted Bool

────────────────────
_ do take-out

. index = log.index-of(steps[0].id)
=? if index == null
for step in steps
    log.remove(index)
log.replay(CommandReplayKind.history, index)

────────────────────
_ do put-back

=? if log.index-of(steps[0].id) != null
. index = log.place-after(steps[0], previous)
for offset in 1 .. < steps.length
    log.place(index + offset, steps[offset])
log.replay(CommandReplayKind.history, index)

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is CommandHistoryEntry ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do undo

if inserted
    take-out()
else
    put-back()

────────────────────
+ do redo

if inserted
    put-back()
else
    take-out()

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ CommandLogReplaceEntry'Step
    is CommandHistoryEntry

+ log CommandLog'Step
+ before Step
+ after Step

────────────────────
+ This
    - log
    - before
    - after

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is CommandHistoryEntry ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do coalesce Bool
    - next CommandHistoryEntry

do match? next
    | CommandLogReplaceEntry'Step
        =? false if it.log as Pointer != log as Pointer || it.before.id != after.id
        after = it.after
        = true
= false

────────────────────
+ do undo

. index = log.index-of(after.id)
=? if index == null
log.replace(index, before)
log.replay(CommandReplayKind.history, index)

────────────────────
+ do redo

. index = log.index-of(before.id)
=? if index == null
log.replace(index, after)
log.replay(CommandReplayKind.history, index)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ CommandLogMoveEntry'Step is Tuple
    is CommandHistoryEntry

+ log CommandLog'Step
+ id U64
+ count Index
+ before U64?
+ after U64?

────────────────────
_ do settle
    - previous U64?

. first = log.index-of(id)
=? if first == null
. moved [Step]
for offset in 0 .. < count
    moved += log.remove(first)
. landed = log.place-after(moved[0], previous)
for offset in 1 .. < moved.length
    log.place(landed + offset, moved[offset])
log.replay(CommandReplayKind.history, min(first, landed))

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is CommandHistoryEntry ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do undo

settle(before)

────────────────────
+ do redo

settle(after)
